<title>USA: Ste. Genevieve Cty, Mo., won by NationsBank, N.A.</title>
<headline>Ste. Genevieve Cty, Mo., won by NationsBank, N.A.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank, N.A., St. Louis said it won $1.200 million of Ste. Genevieve Cty Reorganized SD R-2, Mo., general obligation school bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.25 percent.</p>
</text>
